app
  ctrl+c  ^c  quit  on
  ?       ?   help  on

issue
  esc       esc  back            on
  c         c    comment         on
  l         l    labels          on
  x         x    close           on
  X         X    reopen          off
  r ctrl+r  r    refresh         on
  o         o    browser         on
  enter     ↵    open            off
  ]         ]    next state      off
  [         [    previous state  off
  F         F    clear filters   off
  f         f    filter          off
  s         s    sort            off
  @         @    owner page      on

thread
  up k            ↑/k     up            on
  down j          ↓/j     down          on
  pgup b          b/pgup  page up       on
  pgdown f space  f/pgdn  page down     on
  ctrl+u u        u       ½ page up     on
  ctrl+d d        d       ½ page down   on
  home g          g/home  top           on
  end G           G/end   bottom        on
  enter           ↵       diagram code  off
  r ctrl+r        r       retry         off
